@token=my-token-variable
@port=8080

### Named Request
GET http://go.dev

Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "John Doe"}

### Multi-line Body
GET http://go.dev

Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe"
}

### Test 2
GET http://zed.dev

### Request with variables
GET http://zed.dev:{{port}}

Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
